LIZDINI: Bubbles! Where are you going?
-> MY TADPOLES WERE CAPTURED!
    BUBBLES: MY TADPOLES WERE TAKEN!!
    LIZDINI: WHAT!? I mean.. we got to do something! Right?
    -> Who's We? We're speaking in french?
        BUBBLES: No, you're staying here. It's too risky for you.
        LIZDINI: PLEASE! I can be your sidekick!
        LIZDINI: You know... a duo... Fighting crime??
        -> Just budge and let him.
            BUBBLES: Fine, alright. I do need all of the help I can get.
            LIZDINI: OMG YES! Sooo, how should I help?
            -> Ask about the water.
                BUBBLES: Hey, what's this water over here? It's not poisoned right?
                LIZDINI: No! Perfectly fine water to swim in.
                BUBBLES: Alright, thanks!
